pbt-data

The data in this repository is derived from the game files of Path of Exile. Path of Exile and
its game data are the property of Grinding Gear Games. This repository holds derived values
only (stat ids, numbers, names and text), for non-commercial use; no art, audio or game files.
The data is not licensed by the maintainers of this repository.

This product isn't affiliated with or endorsed by Grinding Gear Games in any way.

Rights holders who want data removed: open an issue at https://github.com/xaroth/pbt-data/issues
or contact the repository owner through GitHub. Requests are handled promptly.

